      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Menomonie%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Mabel Tainter Memorial Building, built in 1890, now houses the Mabel Tainter Center for the Arts, a hub for local artists.",
